nk\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ecdf039ac295751f\" href=\"?note=ecdf039ac295751f\" title=\"73-thm-independent-cover-duality\">73-thm-independent-cover-duality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a2d7611bb7648a0\" href=\"?note=0a2d7611bb7648a0\" title=\"73-df-clique-language\">73-df-clique-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38822aafbdc2b135\" href=\"?note=38822aafbdc2b135\" title=\"73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness\">73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2–10.4.3, Theorems 10.18 and 10.20, print pp. 460–464; PDF pp. 482–486; clique is a local corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IS},\\mathsf{VC},\\mathsf{CLIQUE}\">\\(\\mathsf{IS},\\mathsf{VC},\\mathsf{CLIQUE}\\)</span> 采用已列显式图编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NPComplete}\">\\(\\operatorname{NPComplete}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{IS})\\land\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{VC})\\land\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{CLIQUE}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{IS})\\land\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{VC})\\land\\operatorname{NPComplete}(\\mathsf{CLIQUE}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三者都可猜一个顶点子集并在多项式时间检查。3SAT 的出现图给 IS 的困难性；补顶点给 VC；把图取补且保持 k 给 CLIQUE。非规范输入在各总归约中映到固定否实例，故不是只对合格输入的未补全变换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"5473eb1b238df94f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-independent-cover-duality","status":"resolved","id":"ecdf039ac295751f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-independent-cover-duality]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-clique-language","status":"resolved","id":"0a2d7611bb7648a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-clique-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"38822aafbdc2b135","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-three-sat-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{IS},\\mathsf{VC},\\mathsf{CLIQUE}$ 采用已列显式图编码；$\\operatorname{NPComplete}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]。","embed":false}],"